      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this correct? Let\u0027s say that IPv6 ID in byte order is:\n\n01 02 03 04\n\nIn host order, that\u0027s 04030201. Right-shifting 16 bits results in 0403. Will the store into the __be16 automatically take care of ensuring we have 03 04 on the wire?",
